        <h2 class="section-h2">Import listings <em>in.</em> Push listings <em>out.</em></h2>
        <p class="lead">XML works in both directions. Bring external listings into PropertyList for free, or push your PropertyList listings to every portal and portal you use.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="two-paths-grid">

        <!-- IMPORT CARD -->
        <div class="path-card import">
          <span class="path-tag free">Free forever</span>
          <h3>XML Import<br /><em>Bring listings in.</em></h3>
          <p>Pull property listings from any source - other CRMs, portals, or agencies - directly into your PropertyList account. Every listing arrives with photos, descriptions, prices and details intact. Free, always.</p>
          <ul class="path-list">
            <li>Import from any XML-compatible source</li>
            <li>Listings land in your CRM automatically</li>
            <li>Photos, descriptions, prices all included</li>
            <li>No manual data entry, no CSV wrestling</li>
            <li>Works with your existing portal relationships</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://agents.propertylist.es/settings/export" class="btn btn-ink-outline btn-large">
            Set up free import
            <svg width="16" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M1 6H15M15 6L10 1M15 6L10 11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <p style="margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--quiet);">No credit card. No setup. Works immediately.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- EXPORT CARD -->
        <div class="path-card export">
          <span class="path-tag paid">From 35€/month</span>
          <h3>XML Export<br /><em>Push listings everywhere.</em></h3>
          <p>One live XML feed from PropertyList. Point your website, Idealista, Kyero, Rightmove, Fotocasa, Zoopla or any other portal at it. Every update you make in PropertyList syncs everywhere, automatically, within minutes.</p>
          <ul class="path-list">
            <li>One feed - distributes to unlimited portals</li>
            <li>Real-time sync &mdash; updates appear within minutes</li>
            <li>Sales, long-term rentals, holiday lets - all included</li>
            <li>Works with your existing site or any new one</li>
            <li>Setup support included &mdash; we help you connect it</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://agents.propertylist.es/settings/export" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">
            Activate export feed
            <svg width="16" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M1 6H15M15 6L10 1M15 6L10 11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
