          <div class="no-website-nudge">
            <strong>Don't have a website yet?</strong> You don't need one to start - but when you're ready, <a href="https://info.propertylist.es/website-builder">build your agency site in minutes with the PropertyList Website Builder &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ===== HOW IT WORKS - 3 STEPS ===== -->
  <section class="how">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Up and running in minutes</p>
        <h2 class="section-h2">Three steps, <em>then it runs itself.</em></h2>
        <p class="lead">No developer. No waiting. No API documentation to wade through. If you can copy a URL, you can set this up.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="steps-grid">
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-num">1</div>
          <h3>Activate in settings</h3>
          <p>Go to Settings &rarr; Export in your PropertyList account. Your live XML feed URL is generated instantly - one click, no form to fill, no approval required.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
          <h3>Share the feed URL</h3>
          <p>Copy your feed URL. Paste it into your website CMS, or send it to each portal's data team. Most portals accept XML feeds - we'll help you with any that need setup support.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-num">3</div>
          <h3>Update once, everywhere</h3>
          <p>That's it. Now every change you make in PropertyList - new listing, price change, status update, sold - appears on every portal automatically. Usually within minutes.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


